{"step_index":147,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:32:40Z","thinking":"**Refining Offline Fallback**\n\nI'm now implementing the offline font fallback, ensuring a smooth visual experience even without network connectivity. I've updated `index.html` to prioritize `system-ui`, then `Nunito`, and finally `Arial Rounded MT Bold`. I also addressed the stage dots, using `locked` classes and clean `<button>` tags. Finally, the parent prompt is now updated.\n\n\n**Structuring Data Hierarchy**\n\nI've organized the data into a hierarchical structure. Level 1 categorizes clothing, with attributes for fit and type, such as shirts, jeans, and dresses. Level 2 focuses on luggage, classifying items by category, and level 3 outlines airport security checks, including ticket verification, scanning, and the security gate. Finally, level 4 presents a focused task: Bin's ticket, Gate 03.\n\n\n**Defining Stage Structures**\n\nI'm now mapping out stage structures from levels 5 through 8, establishing components and interactions. Level 5 includes safety signs and puzzle elements. Level 6 introduces four morphing cloud tiles. Level 7 features volume controls and a leg target. Level 8 involves unbuckling, a baggage carousel with a red bear suitcase target, and a replay button. The parent gate modal is next.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <!-- Offline font fallback stack & Google Font -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ (PARENT PROMPT BANNER) -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-icon\" class=\"prompt-icon-badge\">👩</span>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ đồ 6 món trộn lẫn -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" aria-label=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👕</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Áo thun mềm</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"jeans\" aria-label=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👖</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Quần bò cứng</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"pants\" aria-label=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🩳</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Quần thun êm</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"dress\" aria-label=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👗</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Bộ liền rườm rà</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shoes\" aria-label=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👟</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Giày dán tiện</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"boots\" aria-label=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🥾</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Giày nhiều dây</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Nhân vật Bé Bin -->\n                    <div class=\"bin-character-frame\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-dress-target\" class=\"bin-avatar-card\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 66px;\">🧒</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-shirt\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-pants\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-shoes\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-1\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đi Xếp Vali Nào! 🧳 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-2\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"suitcase-arena\">\n                    <!-- Đồ vật bên trái -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🧸</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Gấu bông</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Quần áo\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👕</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Quần áo</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"LEAVE_HOME\" aria-label=\"Kéo nhọn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">✂️</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Kéo nhọn</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Vali Đỏ dán Sticker Gấu -->\n                    <div id=\"suitcase-target-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-box-red\">\n                        <div class=\"suitcase-handle\"></div>\n                        <div id=\"suitcase-inner-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-inner-grid\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"suitcase-bear-badge\">🐻</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Đồ vật bên phải -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Bàn chải\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🪥</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bàn chải</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"ASK_PARENT\" aria-label=\"Bình nước lớn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🍼</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bình lớn</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👒</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Mũ che nắng</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-2\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đến Sân Bay Thôi! 🚗 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-3\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"security-station-grid\">\n                    <!-- Trạm 1: Đưa vé kiểm tra -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 50px;\">👮‍♂️</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #1E88E5;\">1. Kiểm Tra Vé</span>\n                        <div id=\"pass-card-lvl3\" class=\"boarding-pass-chunky\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900;\">✈️ VÉ CỦA BIN</div>\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 26px; text-align: center;\">🎟️</div>\n                            <div id=\"stamp-badge-lvl3\" class=\"stamp-badge\">ĐÃ DUYỆT ✓</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trạm 2: Máy soi chiếu dạ quang -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #00897B;\">2. Máy Soi Chiếu</span>\n                        <div class=\"xray-screen-neon\">\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"🧸\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👕\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👒\">?</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"conveyor-belt\" style=\"width: 85%; margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trạm 3: Cổng an ninh -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #5E35B1;\">3. Cổng An Ninh</span>\n                        <div id=\"gate-detector-lvl3\" class=\"gate-detector-chunky\">\n                            <div class=\"gate-lamps-row\">\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-walker-lvl3\" class=\"kid-walker\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">🧒</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-3\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đi Tìm Cửa Bay Nào! 🚪 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-4\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"boarding-hall-arena\">\n                    <!-- Thẻ vé máy bay của Bin -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        <div class=\"boarding-pass-chunky\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 100px; background: #FFFDE7; border-color: #FFA000;\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #E65100;\">✈️ VÉ CỦA BÉ BIN</div>\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 26px;\">\n                                <span>🧒</span> <strong>CỔNG 03</strong>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 4 Cổng bay lớn phong cách BillionAir -->\n                    <div class=\"gates-array-row\">\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"01\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">01</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🥕</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"02\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">02</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🍯</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"03\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">03</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">✈️</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"05\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">05</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🌲</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-4\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Vào Ghế Ngồi Thôi! ✈️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-5\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cabin-seat-arena\">\n                    <!-- Ghế ngồi máy bay của Bin -->\n                    <div class=\"seat-plush-box\">\n                        <div id=\"safety-sign-lvl5\" class=\"safety-sign-led\">ĐÈN BÁO CÀI ĐAI</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-seat-head\" style=\"font-size: 74px;\">🧒</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-knight-cape\" class=\"knight-cape-icon\">🦸‍♂️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave left hidden\">〰️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave right hidden\">〰️</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Khóa đai & Nút uống nước -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n                        <div id=\"seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5\" class=\"seatbelt-puzzle\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); border-radius: 28px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #CFD8DC;\">\n                            <div class=\"seatbelt-straps-row\">\n                                <div id=\"seatbelt-strap-lvl5\" class=\"strap-left\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-insert\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"strap-right\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-receiver\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button id=\"btn-drink-water-lvl5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary hidden\" style=\"font-size: 19px; padding: 14px;\">\n                            🥤 Uống một ngụm nước\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Ngắm Mây Qua Cửa Sổ! ☁️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-6\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cloud-window-frame\">\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bunny\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 1</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"car\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 2</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"watermelon\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 3</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bear\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 54px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 4</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-6\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Học Nói Nhỏ Nhé! 🤫 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-7\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"etiquette-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tình huống 1: 3 Nút mức âm lượng với nhãn chữ bên dưới -->\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 46px;\">👩‍🦰</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 19px;\">NÓI NHỎ VỪA ĐỦ NGHE</span>\n                        <div class=\"volume-emotion-options\">\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"loud\" aria-label=\"Nói to\">\n                                <span>😮</span>\n                                <small style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; display: block;\">Nói to</small>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"medium\" aria-label=\"Nói vừa\">\n                                <span>🙂</span>\n                                <small style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; display: block;\">Nói vừa</small>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"whisper\" aria-label=\"Nói nhỏ\">\n                                <span>🤫</span>\n                                <small style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; display: block;\">Nói nhỏ</small>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tình huống 2: Không đạp ghế trước -->\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 46px;\">💺</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 19px;\">Không Đạp Lưng Ghế</span>\n                        <button id=\"bin-leg-target\" style=\"font-size: 50px; border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer;\" title=\"Chạm để thu chân\">\n                            👟🦶\n                        </button>\n                        <span id=\"leg-status-label\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #0277BD;\">Chạm để thu chân lại</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-7\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Máy Bay Hạ Cánh Rồi! 🛬 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & NHẬN PHẦN THƯỞNG\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-8\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-final-arena\">\n                    <!-- Bước 1: Máy bay dừng hẳn mới mở đai (Bắt đầu ở trạng thái DISABLED) -->\n                    <button id=\"unbuckle-latch-btn\" class=\"tycoon-btn\" disabled style=\"border: 3px dashed #78909C; font-size: 19px; padding: 14px 28px; opacity: 0.6;\">\n                        <span>⏳ Máy bay đang chạy vào bãi đỗ...</span>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Băng chuyền hành lý (5 chiếc vali đầy màu sắc) -->\n                    <div id=\"baggage-carousel-lvl8\" class=\"carousel-track-chunky hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"carousel-suitcases-track\">\n                            <!-- 1. Vali Đỏ dán Sticker Gấu của Bin -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FF5252 0%, #D50000 100%); border: 4px solid #FFD54F;\" data-is-bin=\"true\" aria-label=\"Vali đỏ hình gấu\">\n                                <span>🐻</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 2. Vali Xanh dương dán Tên lửa -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #29B6F6 0%, #0288D1 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\" data-is-bin=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vali xanh tên lửa\">\n                                <span>🚀</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 3. Vali Vàng dán Trái cherry -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFEE58 0%, #FDD835 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\" data-is-bin=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vali vàng quả cherry\">\n                                <span>🍒</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 4. Vali Bạc dán Quả bóng đá -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ECEFF1 0%, #B0BEC5 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\" data-is-bin=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vali bạc bóng đá\">\n                                <span>⚽</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- 5. Vali Tím dán Ngôi sao vàng -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #BA68C8 0%, #7B1FA2 100%); border: 4px solid #FFF;\" data-is-bin=\"false\" aria-label=\"Vali tím ngôi sao\">\n                                <span>⭐</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modal Huy Hiệu Vàng & Phần Thưởng -->\n                <div id=\"golden-medal-modal\" class=\"golden-medal-modal\">\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 68px;\">🎖️</div>\n                    <h2 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #E65100; margin: 8px 0;\">HÀNH KHÁCH NHÍ XUẤT SẮC</h2>\n                    <div style=\"background: #E1F5FE; color: #0277BD; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block;\">\n                        🌟 BÉ BIN ĐÃ HOÀN THÀNH CHUYẾN BAY ĐẦU TIÊN 🌟\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div style=\"margin: 16px 0;\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 74px;\">🛩️</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 17px; color: #2E7D32;\">✨ Đã nhận Mô hình Máy Bay vào bộ sưu tập của Bin!</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button id=\"btn-replay-adventure\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary\" style=\"font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 30px;\">\n                        🔄 Chơi Lại Cùng Bin\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- MODAL CỔNG BA MẸ (3-SECOND PARENT CONTROL HUB) -->\n        <div id=\"parent-modal\" class=\"parent-modal-overlay\">\n            <div class=\"parent-control-card\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #D84315; font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">🛡️ Cổng Dành Cho Ba Mẹ</h2>\n                \n                <div class=\"parent-tip-box\">\n                    <strong>💡 Giúp tai bé dễ chịu khi máy bay lên/xuống:</strong> Khi cất cánh hoặc hạ cánh, cho bé ngồi thẳng và uống từng ngụm nước nhỏ để khuyến khích động tác nuốt, giúp tai dễ chịu hơn. Nếu bé đau tai nhiều hoặc đang có bệnh lý tai mũi họng, ba mẹ nên tham khảo ý kiến bác sĩ trước chuyến bay.\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"parent-tip-box\">\n                    <strong>💡 Chuẩn bị tâm lý trước chuyến đi:</strong> Cùng bé xem trước các bước trong ứng dụng này để bé làm quen với không khí sân bay và các bước an toàn trước khi bay thực tế.\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Chọn nhanh màn chơi -->\n                <div style=\"margin: 12px 0;\">\n                    <strong style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #37474F;\">Chọn nhanh màn chơi:</strong>\n                    <div class=\"level-jump-grid\">\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"1\">1. Mặc đồ</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"2\">2. Xếp vali</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"3\">3. An ninh</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"4\">4. Cổng bay</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"5\">5. Đai an toàn</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"6\">6. Ngắm mây</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"7\">7. Lịch sự</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"8\">8. Nhận vali</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Cài đặt âm thanh & chuyển động -->\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin: 10px 0; font-weight: 800;\">\n                    <span>Âm lượng hiệu ứng:</span>\n                    <input id=\"setting-volume\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.85\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 26px;\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin: 10px 0; font-weight: 800;\">\n                    <span>Giảm hiệu ứng chuyển động:</span>\n                    <input id=\"setting-reduced-motion\" type=\"checkbox\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px;\">\n                    <button id=\"btn-reset-app\" class=\"tycoon-btn\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 16px;\">\n                        🔄 Chơi lại từ đầu\n                    </button>\n                    <button id=\"btn-close-parent\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 16px;\">\n                        Đóng Bảng Cài Đặt ✓\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script src=\"js/audio.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"js/effects.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"js/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Cập nhật index.html với selector chuẩn và đồng bộ toàn diện với JS","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\index.html","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update index.html with synchronized markup"}}]}
{"step_index":148,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:33:08Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-26T11:33:08+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-26T11:33:08+07:00\nCreated file file:///c:/Demo.plane/index.html with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":149,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:33:08Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Controller Logic**\n\nOkay, I'm now zeroing in on the controller logic, specifically within `js/app.js`. I've established the `levelInitialized` dictionary, aiming to prevent listener duplicates, which is crucial. Also, the `maxUnlockedLevel = 1` initialization is set. I'm building out locked stage dot behaviors with strict validation to ensure the appropriate behavior of target screens.\n\n\n**Unlocking Level Progression**\n\nI've just added the critical progression unlocks. Specifically, `unlockLevel(nextLevel)` is now active after a level finishes. I'm also examining the parent prompt API, `showParentPrompt()`, to maintain on-screen text and accommodate dynamic user input. I'm starting to build out level-specific logic, beginning with level 1's behavior and selectors. Level 1 involves soft/stiff clothing validation, and prompts from Mẹ. The next step is fleshing out Level 2, focusing on luggage selection within a vali.\n\n\n**Developing Level 3 Gameplay**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in developing Level 3's intricate gameplay flow. I've integrated the initial prompt and am working through each step: the pass-card check, the xray scan, and the gate detector. I'm focusing on ensuring each action triggers the appropriate audio feedback, like `playStamp()` and `playTing()`. I've defined the success criteria with `checkin`, `xrayCount`, and `gate` variables, and confirmed that the Next button displays accordingly.\n\n\n**Implementing Level 5 & 6**\n\nI've just finished up Level 5. I've programmed Mẹ's prompts and Bin's responses based on safety actions. Audio and visual cues are integrated at each step, from the seatbelt buckle to the water break. I then began building level 6, focusing on cloud morphing. I've designed the visual morphing effects and audio feedback for the cloud shape matching and implemented the prompt sequences. I have also added level 7 which uses volume controls and posture.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * app.js - Main Controller for \"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay\" (8 Levels)\n * Đồng bộ toàn diện 100% với HTML/CSS/Audio/Effects\n * Tuân thủ mô hình Sách Tương Tác Ba Mẹ Đọc Cho Bé (Parent-Co-Play)\n */\n\nclass KidFlightApp {\n    constructor() {\n        this.currentScreen = 1;\n        this.totalScreens = 8;\n        this.maxUnlockedLevel = 1;\n        \n        // Ngăn chặn duplicate event listeners khi quay lại màn\n        this.levelInitialized = {\n            1: false, 2: false, 3: false, 4: false,\n            5: false, 6: false, 7: false, 8: false\n        };\n\n        // Trạng thái các Level\n        this.level1Dressed = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false };\n        this.level2Packed = 0;\n        this.level3Steps = { checkin: false, xrayCount: 0, gate: false };\n        this.level4Completed = false;\n        this.level5Belt = { inserted: false, earRelieved: false };\n        this.level6Clouds = { c1: false, c2: false, c3: false, c4: false };\n        this.level7Tasks = { volume: false, leg: false };\n        this.level8State = { planeStopped: false, unbuckled: false, baggage: false };\n\n        this.parentHoldStart = 0;\n        this.parentHoldReqId = null;\n\n        this.init();\n    }\n\n    init() {\n        this.bindGlobalEvents();\n        this.initLevel(1);\n        this.showScreen(1);\n    }\n\n    // --- PARENT PROMPT API (HIỂN THỊ CÂU THOẠI TRÊN BIỂN BÁO BA MẸ ĐỌC) ---\n    showParentPrompt(speaker, text, avatarEmoji = null) {\n        if (window.dialogueMgr) {\n            window.dialogueMgr.show(speaker, text, avatarEmoji);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // --- NAVIGATION & STAGE LOCKING CONTROLLER ---\n    unlockLevel(levelNum) {\n        if (levelNum > this.maxUnlockedLevel && levelNum <= this.totalScreens) {\n            this.maxUnlockedLevel = levelNum;\n            const dot = document.querySelector(`.stage-dot[data-screen=\"${levelNum}\"]`);\n            if (dot) {\n                dot.classList.remove('locked');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    showScreen(screenNum) {\n        if (screenNum < 1 || screenNum > this.totalScreens) return;\n\n        // Dừng động cơ máy bay nếu rời Level 5\n        if (this.currentScreen === 5 && screenNum !== 5) {\n            if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.stopEngineSound();\n        }\n\n        this.currentScreen = screenNum;\n        this.unlockLevel(screenNum);\n\n        // Cập nhật DOM screen\n        document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach((scr, idx) => {\n            if (idx + 1 === screenNum) {\n                scr.classList.add('active');\n            } else {\n                scr.classList.remove('active');\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Cập nhật Stage dots (chỉ mở khóa màn đã chơi hoặc hiện tại)\n        document.querySelectorAll('.stage-dot').forEach((dot, idx) => {\n            const level = idx + 1;\n            dot.classList.remove('active', 'completed', 'locked');\n\n            if (level === screenNum) {\n                dot.classList.add('active');\n            } else if (level < screenNum || level <= this.maxUnlockedLevel) {\n                dot.classList.add('completed');\n            } else {\n                dot.classList.add('locked');\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Khởi tạo sự kiện màn nếu chưa khởi tạo\n        this.initLevel(screenNum);\n\n        // Hiển thị lời thoại ban đầu chuẩn của màn chơi\n        this.setInitialScreenDialogue(screenNum);\n    }\n\n    setInitialScreenDialogue(screenNum) {\n        switch (screenNum) {\n            case 1:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”', '👩');\n                break;\n            case 2:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Bin mang gì đi máy bay nhỉ? Con xếp vali giúp Bin nhé!”', '👨');\n                break;\n            case 3:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Đến chỗ kiểm tra an ninh rồi. Bin đi cùng Ba Mẹ và làm theo hướng dẫn nhé!”', '👩');\n                break;\n            case 4:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Vé của Bin ghi số 03. Con tìm cổng số 03 nhé!”', '👨');\n                break;\n            case 5:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Con giúp Bin cài dây an toàn nhé!”', '👩');\n                break;\n            case 6:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy đám mây giống hình gì nhỉ? Con nhìn cùng Bin nhé!”', '🧒');\n                break;\n            case 7:\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Trên máy bay mình nói nhỏ vừa đủ nghe nhé. Con giúp Bin nào!”', '👩');\n                break;\n            case 8:\n                // Level 8: SAFETY BLOCKER - Máy bay chạy vào chỗ đỗ trước\n                this.level8State.planeStopped = false;\n                this.level8State.unbuckled = false;\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Máy bay đang chạy vào chỗ đỗ. Bin vẫn ngồi yên và giữ dây an toàn nhé!”', '👨');\n                \n                const unbuckleBtn = document.getElementById('unbuckle-latch-btn');\n                if (unbuckleBtn) {\n                    unbuckleBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');\n                    unbuckleBtn.style.opacity = '0.6';\n                    unbuckleBtn.style.borderColor = '#FF5252';\n                    unbuckleBtn.innerHTML = '<span>⏳ Máy bay đang chạy vào bãi đỗ...</span>';\n                }\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    this.level8State.planeStopped = true;\n                    if (unbuckleBtn) {\n                        unbuckleBtn.removeAttribute('disabled');\n                        unbuckleBtn.style.opacity = '1';\n                        unbuckleBtn.style.borderColor = '#00E676';\n                        unbuckleBtn.innerHTML = '<span>🔓 Máy bay đã dừng hẳn — Mở dây an toàn</span>';\n                    }\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Máy bay dừng hẳn rồi. Bây giờ mình mới mở dây nhé!”', '👩');\n                }, 2600);\n                break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // --- GLOBAL EVENTS & CỔNG BA MẸ CONTROLLER ---\n    bindGlobalEvents() {\n        const parentBtn = document.getElementById('btn-parent-gate');\n        const holdCircle = document.getElementById('parent-ring-circle');\n        const modal = document.getElementById('parent-modal');\n        const closeModalBtn = document.getElementById('btn-close-parent');\n\n        // Cổng Ba Mẹ: Giữ 3 giây\n        if (parentBtn && holdCircle) {\n            const startHold = (e) => {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                this.parentHoldStart = Date.now();\n                const totalHold = 3000;\n\n                const updateRing = () => {\n                    const elapsed = Date.now() - this.parentHoldStart;\n                    const progress = Math.min(1, elapsed / totalHold);\n                    const offset = 175 - (175 * progress);\n                    holdCircle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\n\n                    if (progress >= 1) {\n                        if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                        modal.classList.add('open');\n                        resetHold();\n                    } else {\n                        this.parentHoldReqId = requestAnimationFrame(updateRing);\n                    }\n                };\n\n                this.parentHoldReqId = requestAnimationFrame(updateRing);\n            };\n\n            const resetHold = () => {\n                if (this.parentHoldReqId) cancelAnimationFrame(this.parentHoldReqId);\n                holdCircle.style.strokeDashoffset = 175;\n            };\n\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerdown', startHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerup', resetHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerleave', resetHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointercancel', resetHold);\n        }\n\n        if (closeModalBtn && modal) {\n            closeModalBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                modal.classList.remove('open');\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Tùy chỉnh trong Cổng Ba Mẹ\n        const volSlider = document.getElementById('setting-volume');\n        if (volSlider) {\n            volSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.volume = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n            });\n        }\n\n        const motionToggle = document.getElementById('setting-reduced-motion');\n        if (motionToggle) {\n            motionToggle.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n                if (window.effectsMgr) window.effectsMgr.reducedMotion = e.target.checked;\n            });\n        }\n\n        const resetBtn = document.getElementById('btn-reset-app');\n        if (resetBtn) {\n            resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                window.location.reload();\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Nút chọn nhanh màn chơi trong Cổng Ba Mẹ (Ba Mẹ được quyền nhảy tự do)\n        document.querySelectorAll('.jump-btn').forEach(btn => {\n            btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                const target = parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-level'), 10);\n                if (target) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    modal.classList.remove('open');\n                    this.unlockLevel(target);\n                    this.showScreen(target);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Stage dots điều hướng: Chỉ cho phép click màn hiện tại và màn đã mở khóa\n        document.querySelectorAll('.stage-dot').forEach((dot) => {\n            dot.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                const targetScreen = parseInt(dot.getAttribute('data-screen'), 10);\n                if (!dot.classList.contains('locked') && targetScreen && targetScreen <= this.maxUnlockedLevel) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.showScreen(targetScreen);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    }\n\n    initLevel(levelNum) {\n        if (this.levelInitialized[levelNum]) return;\n        this.levelInitialized[levelNum] = true;\n\n        switch (levelNum) {\n            case 1: this.initLevel1(); break;\n            case 2: this.initLevel2(); break;\n            case 3: this.initLevel3(); break;\n            case 4: this.initLevel4(); break;\n            case 5: this.initLevel5(); break;\n            case 6: this.initLevel6(); break;\n            case 7: this.initLevel7(); break;\n            case 8: this.initLevel8(); break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI (#screen-1 [data-clothing-item=\"true\"])\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel1() {\n        const clothesTiles = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-1 [data-clothing-item=\"true\"]');\n        const binAvatar = document.getElementById('bin-dress-target');\n        const btnNext1 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-1');\n\n        const tryDressItem = (tile) => {\n            if (tile.classList.contains('worn')) return;\n            const isFit = tile.getAttribute('data-fit') === 'soft';\n            const type = tile.getAttribute('data-type');\n            const binRect = binAvatar.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            if (isFit) {\n                tile.classList.add('worn');\n                tile.style.display = 'none';\n\n                if (type === 'shirt') {\n                    document.getElementById('bin-slot-shirt').textContent = '👕';\n                    this.level1Dressed.shirt = true;\n                } else if (type === 'pants') {\n                    document.getElementById('bin-slot-pants').textContent = '🩳';\n                    this.level1Dressed.pants = true;\n                } else if (type === 'shoes') {\n                    document.getElementById('bin-slot-shoes').textContent = '👟';\n                    this.level1Dressed.shoes = true;\n                }\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(binRect.left + binRect.width / 2, binRect.top + binRect.height / 2);\n                }\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Đúng rồi! Bộ này mềm và dễ vận động.”', '👩');\n\n                if (this.level1Dressed.shirt && this.level1Dressed.pants && this.level1Dressed.shoes) {\n                    binAvatar.classList.add('gentle-bounce');\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Bin mặc đồ xong rồi, cùng đi xếp vali nào!”', '👩');\n                    this.unlockLevel(2);\n                    if (btnNext1) {\n                        btnNext1.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext1.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            } else {\n                tile.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                tile.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Món này hơi bất tiện. Con thử món khác nhé!”', '👨');\n            }\n        };\n\n        clothesTiles.forEach(tile => {\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (tile.classList.contains('worn')) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                tile.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                tile.style.zIndex = '999';\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const dx = e.clientX - startX;\n                const dy = e.clientY - startY;\n                tile.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(1.18)`;\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                tile.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n\n                const tileRect = tile.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const binRect = binAvatar.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n                const isOver = !(\n                    tileRect.right < binRect.left ||\n                    tileRect.left > binRect.right ||\n                    tileRect.bottom < binRect.top ||\n                    tileRect.top > binRect.bottom\n                );\n\n                if (isOver) {\n                    tryDressItem(tile);\n                } else {\n                    tile.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                    tile.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            tile.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            tile.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            tile.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n            tile.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n\n            tile.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (!tile.classList.contains('worn')) {\n                    tryDressItem(tile);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext1) {\n            btnNext1.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(2);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU (#screen-2 [data-luggage-item=\"true\"])\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel2() {\n        const luggageItems = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-2 [data-luggage-item=\"true\"]');\n        const suitcase = document.getElementById('suitcase-target-lvl2');\n        const suitcaseInner = document.getElementById('suitcase-inner-lvl2');\n        const btnNext2 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-2');\n\n        const tryPackLuggage = (item) => {\n            if (item.classList.contains('packed')) return;\n            const category = item.getAttribute('data-category');\n            const suitcaseRect = suitcase.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            if (category === 'PACK') {\n                item.classList.add('packed');\n                item.style.display = 'none';\n\n                const iconSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                iconSpan.textContent = item.querySelector('.item-icon').textContent;\n                iconSpan.style.fontSize = '34px';\n                iconSpan.className = 'pop-in';\n                suitcaseInner.appendChild(iconSpan);\n\n                this.level2Packed++;\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(suitcaseRect.left + suitcaseRect.width / 2, suitcaseRect.top + suitcaseRect.height / 2);\n                }\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Ừ! Món này mình xếp vào vali nhé.”', '👩');\n\n                if (this.level2Packed >= 3) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Vali của Bin đã sẵn sàng rồi! Cùng đến sân bay thôi!”', '👩');\n                    this.unlockLevel(3);\n                    if (btnNext2) {\n                        btnNext2.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext2.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            } else if (category === 'ASK_PARENT') {\n                item.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Món này mình hỏi Ba Mẹ trước nhé!”', '👨');\n            } else {\n                // LEAVE_HOME\n                item.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Món này để Ba Mẹ giúp mình xử lý nhé.”', '👨');\n            }\n        };\n\n        luggageItems.forEach(item => {\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (item.classList.contains('packed')) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                item.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                item.style.zIndex = '999';\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const dx = e.clientX - startX;\n                const dy = e.clientY - startY;\n                item.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(1.18)`;\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                item.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n\n                const itemRect = item.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const suitcaseRect = suitcase.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n                const isOver = !(\n                    itemRect.right < suitcaseRect.left ||\n                    itemRect.left > suitcaseRect.right ||\n                    itemRect.bottom < suitcaseRect.top ||\n                    itemRect.top > suitcaseRect.bottom\n                );\n\n                if (isOver) {\n                    tryPackLuggage(item);\n                } else {\n                    item.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                    item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            item.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            item.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            item.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n            item.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n\n            item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (!item.classList.contains('packed')) {\n                    tryPackLuggage(item);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext2) {\n            btnNext2.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(3);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel3() {\n        const passCard = document.getElementById('pass-card-lvl3');\n        const stampBadge = document.getElementById('stamp-badge-lvl3');\n        const xrayBoxes = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-3 .xray-tap-box');\n        const gate = document.getElementById('gate-detector-lvl3');\n        const lamps = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-3 .gate-lamp-led');\n        const binWalker = document.getElementById('bin-walker-lvl3');\n        const btnNext3 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-3');\n\n        // Bước 1: Kiểm tra vé\n        if (passCard) {\n            passCard.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level3Steps.checkin) return;\n                this.level3Steps.checkin = true;\n                if (stampBadge) stampBadge.classList.add('stamped');\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playStamp();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Tiếp viên', '“Vé của Bin xong rồi! Giờ soi chiếu vali nhé.”', '👩‍✈️');\n                this.checkLevel3Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        // Bước 2: Chạm 3 khối máy soi X-quang\n        xrayBoxes.forEach(box => {\n            box.onclick = () => {\n                if (box.getAttribute('data-revealed') === 'true') return;\n                box.setAttribute('data-revealed', 'true');\n                box.textContent = box.getAttribute('data-item');\n                box.style.background = '#FFF9C4';\n                this.level3Steps.xrayCount++;\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = box.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n\n                if (this.level3Steps.xrayCount >= 3) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Vali của Bin an toàn rồi! Chạm để Bin qua cổng nhé.”', '👩');\n                    this.checkLevel3Completion();\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        // Bước 3: Cổng an ninh\n        if (gate) {\n            gate.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level3Steps.gate) return;\n                this.level3Steps.gate = true;\n\n                lamps.forEach(l => l.classList.add('green-flash'));\n                if (binWalker) binWalker.style.transform = 'translateY(-18px) scale(1.15)';\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBeepBoop();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Bíp boong! Bin qua cửa an toàn rồi!”', '👩');\n                this.checkLevel3Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext3) {\n            btnNext3.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(4);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    checkLevel3Completion() {\n        const btnNext3 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-3');\n        if (this.level3Steps.checkin && this.level3Steps.xrayCount >= 3 && this.level3Steps.gate) {\n            this.unlockLevel(4);\n            if (btnNext3) {\n                btnNext3.classList.remove('hidden');\n                btnNext3.classList.add('pop-in');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY (TẬP TRUNG TÌM CỔNG 03)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel4() {\n        const gatePillars = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-4 .gate-pillar');\n        const btnNext4 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-4');\n\n        gatePillars.forEach(pillar => {\n            pillar.onclick = () => {\n                const targetGate = pillar.getAttribute('data-gate');\n\n                if (targetGate === '03') {\n                    this.level4Completed = true;\n                    pillar.classList.add('matched');\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        const r = pillar.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                    }\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playConnect();\n\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Tiếp viên', '“Đúng Cổng 03 rồi! Chào mừng Bin lên máy bay!”', '👩‍✈️');\n                    this.unlockLevel(5);\n\n                    if (btnNext4) {\n                        btnNext4.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext4.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Chưa đúng số trên vé rồi, con tìm lại nhé!”', '👨');\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext4) {\n            btnNext4.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(5);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel5() {\n        const strapLeft = document.getElementById('seatbelt-strap-lvl5');\n        const puzzleBox = document.getElementById('seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5');\n        const safetySign = document.getElementById('safety-sign-lvl5');\n        const knightCape = document.getElementById('bin-knight-cape');\n        const btnWater = document.getElementById('btn-drink-water-lvl5');\n        const earWaves = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-5 .ear-soundwave');\n        const btnNext5 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-5');\n\n        const tryBuckleBelt = () => {\n            if (this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n            this.level5Belt.inserted = true;\n            puzzleBox.classList.add('seatbelt-buckled');\n\n            if (safetySign) safetySign.classList.add('green-safe');\n            if (knightCape) knightCape.classList.add('active');\n\n            if (window.audioMgr) {\n                window.audioMgr.playClack();\n                window.audioMgr.startEngineSound(0.22);\n            }\n\n            if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                const r = puzzleBox.getBoundingClientRect();\n                window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n            }\n\n            this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“CẠCH! Dây an toàn chắc chắn rồi!”', '👩');\n\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                earWaves.forEach(w => w.classList.remove('hidden'));\n                if (btnWater) btnWater.classList.remove('hidden');\n                this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Tai Bin hơi khó chịu. Bin uống một ngụm nước nhé.”', '👩');\n            }, 3000);\n        };\n\n        if (strapLeft && puzzleBox) {\n            let isDragging = false;\n            let startX = 0;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                strapLeft.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging || this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n                const dx = Math.max(0, Math.min(45, e.clientX - startX));\n                strapLeft.style.transform = `translateX(${dx}px)`;\n\n                if (dx >= 35) {\n                    tryBuckleBelt();\n                }\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                strapLeft.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                if (!this.level5Belt.inserted) {\n                    strapLeft.style.transform = 'translateX(0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n\n            puzzleBox.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                tryBuckleBelt();\n            });\n        }\n\n        if (btnWater) {\n            btnWater.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level5Belt.earRelieved) return;\n                this.level5Belt.earRelieved = true;\n\n                earWaves.forEach(w => w.classList.add('hidden'));\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const binHead = document.getElementById('bin-seat-head');\n                    if (binHead) {\n                        const r = binHead.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.spawnMusicNotesAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playDrinkWater();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Tai Bin dễ chịu hơn rồi!”', '🧒');\n                this.unlockLevel(6);\n\n                if (btnNext5) {\n                    btnNext5.classList.remove('hidden');\n                    btnNext5.classList.add('pop-in');\n                }\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext5) {\n            btnNext5.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(6);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH (LỜI THOẠI MỞ)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel6() {\n        const cloudTiles = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-6 .morph-cloud-tile');\n        const btnNext6 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-6');\n\n        cloudTiles.forEach(tile => {\n            tile.onclick = () => {\n                if (tile.classList.contains('morphed')) return;\n                tile.classList.add('morphed');\n\n                const morphType = tile.getAttribute('data-morph');\n                const icon = tile.querySelector('.cloud-icon');\n                const label = tile.querySelector('.cloud-label');\n\n                if (morphType === 'bunny') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🐰';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chú thỏ';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c1 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống chú thỏ! Còn con thấy giống gì?”', '🧒');\n                } else if (morphType === 'car') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🚗';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chiếc ô tô';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c2 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống ô tô chạy! Còn con thấy giống gì?”', '🧒');\n                } else if (morphType === 'watermelon') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🍉';\n                    label.textContent = 'Miếng dưa hấu';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c3 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống miếng dưa hấu! Còn con thấy giống gì?”', '🧒');\n                } else if (morphType === 'bear') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🐻';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chú gấu';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c4 = true;\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Bin thấy giống chú gấu vẫy tay! Còn con thấy giống gì?”', '🧒');\n                }\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = tile.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBling();\n\n                if (this.level6Clouds.c1 && this.level6Clouds.c2 && this.level6Clouds.c3 && this.level6Clouds.c4) {\n                    this.unlockLevel(7);\n                    if (btnNext6) {\n                        btnNext6.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext6.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext6) {\n            btnNext6.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(7);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ (3 NÚT ÂM LƯỢNG TRỰC QUAN)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel7() {\n        const emotionBtns = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-7 .volume-emotion-btn');\n        const legTarget = document.getElementById('bin-leg-target');\n        const legLabel = document.getElementById('leg-status-label');\n        const btnNext7 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-7');\n\n        emotionBtns.forEach(btn => {\n            btn.onclick = () => {\n                emotionBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('selected'));\n                btn.classList.add('selected');\n                const level = btn.getAttribute('data-level');\n\n                if (level === 'loud') {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Ơ, hơi to rồi. Con thử nhỏ hơn nhé!”', '👩');\n                } else if (level === 'medium') {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Nhỏ hơn một chút nữa nhé!”', '👩');\n                } else if (level === 'whisper') {\n                    this.level7Tasks.volume = true;\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        const r = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.spawnFloatingHeartsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                    }\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bin', '“Đúng rồi! Mình nói nhỏ vừa đủ nghe nhé.”', '🧒');\n                    this.checkLevel7Completion();\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (legTarget) {\n            legTarget.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level7Tasks.leg) return;\n                this.level7Tasks.leg = true;\n                legTarget.style.transform = 'translateY(16px)';\n                if (legLabel) legLabel.textContent = 'Chân Bin đã thu lại ngay ngắn ✓';\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = legTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.spawnFloatingHeartsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                }\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Bin ngồi ngoan, không đạp ghế trước!”', '👨');\n                this.checkLevel7Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext7) {\n            btnNext7.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.showScreen(8);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    checkLevel7Completion() {\n        const btnNext7 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-7');\n        if (this.level7Tasks.volume && this.level7Tasks.leg) {\n            this.unlockLevel(8);\n            if (btnNext7) {\n                btnNext7.classList.remove('hidden');\n                btnNext7.classList.add('pop-in');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & NHẬN PHẦN THƯỞNG (SAFETY BLOCKER)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel8() {\n        const unbuckleLatch = document.getElementById('unbuckle-latch-btn');\n        const baggageCarousel = document.getElementById('baggage-carousel-lvl8');\n        const bags = document.querySelectorAll('#screen-8 .carousel-bag-tile');\n        const medalModal = document.getElementById('golden-medal-modal');\n        const btnReplay = document.getElementById('btn-replay-adventure');\n\n        // Bước 1: Máy bay dừng hẳn mới cho phép mở đai\n        if (unbuckleLatch) {\n            unbuckleLatch.onclick = () => {\n                if (!this.level8State.planeStopped) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Máy bay đang chạy vào chỗ đỗ. Bin vẫn ngồi yên và giữ dây an toàn nhé!”', '👨');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                if (this.level8State.unbuckled) return;\n                this.level8State.unbuckled = true;\n                unbuckleLatch.innerHTML = '<span>🔓 Đai an toàn đã mở ✓</span>';\n                unbuckleLatch.style.borderColor = '#00E676';\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playUnbuckle();\n                this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Con tìm chiếc vali đỏ có hình gấu của Bin nhé!”', '👨');\n\n                if (baggageCarousel) baggageCarousel.classList.remove('hidden');\n            };\n        }\n\n        // Bước 2: Bắt đúng vali đỏ dán hình gấu\n        bags.forEach(bag => {\n            bag.onclick = () => {\n                if (!this.level8State.unbuckled) {\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Máy bay dừng hẳn rồi. Bây giờ mình mới mở dây an toàn nhé!”', '👩');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                const isBinBag = bag.getAttribute('data-is-bin') === 'true';\n\n                if (isBinBag) {\n                    this.level8State.baggage = true;\n                    bag.style.transform = 'scale(1.4) translateY(-18px)';\n                    const track = document.querySelector('.carousel-suitcases-track');\n                    if (track) track.classList.add('paused');\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        window.effectsMgr.startCelebrationFireworks(3000);\n                    }\n\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playFanfare();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Mẹ', '“Hoan hô! Bin tìm đúng vali rồi!”', '👩');\n\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        if (medalModal) medalModal.classList.add('show');\n                    }, 1200);\n                } else {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                    this.showParentPrompt('Bố', '“Vali của bạn khác rồi, con tìm chiếc màu đỏ dán hình gấu nhé!”', '👨');\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnReplay) {\n            btnReplay.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                window.location.reload();\n            };\n        }\n    }\n}\n\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    window.kidFlightApp = new KidFlightApp();\n});\n","Description":"Cập nhật app.js đồng bộ chuẩn 100% với HTML và kịch bản 8 màn chơi","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\app.js","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update app.js with synchronized runtime"}}]}
