{"step_index":151,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:33:32Z","thinking":"**Verifying Font Fallback**\n\nI'm currently verifying the font stack in `css/style.css`. It appears `\"Nunito\"` is the primary font, with `\"Arial Rounded MT Bold\"`, `system-ui`, `-apple-system`, and `sans-serif` serving as fallbacks. I am also checking the styling applied to `.volume-emotion-btn small` to confirm text rendering.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CÙNG BÉ BIN ĐI MÁY BAY - RICH COLORFUL 3D TYCOON DESIGN SYSTEM\n   - Font Offline Fallback: Nunito -> Arial Rounded MT Bold -> system-ui -> sans-serif\n   - Tươi sáng, độ bão hòa cao, bo tròn đồ chơi, viền đáy 3D đậm, đổ bóng đa tầng\n   - Mô hình Parent-Co-Play: Chữ to rõ ràng $\\ge 22px$, giao diện tương tác cực đại\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --color-sky-blue: #29B6F6;\n    --color-sky-deep: #0288D1;\n    --color-sun-yellow: #FFD54F;\n    --color-sun-orange: #FF9800;\n    --color-candy-red: #FF5252;\n    --color-candy-red-deep: #D50000;\n    --color-mint-green: #69F0AE;\n    --color-emerald: #00E676;\n    --color-royal-blue: #1976D2;\n    --color-purple: #BA68C8;\n    --color-warm-wood: #8D6E63;\n    --text-dark: #1A237E;\n    --text-muted: #455A64;\n    --shadow-chunky: 0 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16), 0 16px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n    --shadow-glow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 213, 79, 0.8);\n    --radius-toy: 32px;\n    --radius-round: 9999px;\n}\n\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    user-select: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: \"Nunito\", \"Arial Rounded MT Bold\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4FC3F7 0%, #81D4FA 35%, #FFE082 70%, #FF8A65 100%);\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n#app-root {\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n#effects-canvas {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TOP BAR: 8 STAGE ICONS RỰC RỠ & CỔNG BA MẸ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.top-nav {\n    height: 68px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 50;\n}\n\n.stage-indicators {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n    border: 3px solid #FFF;\n}\n\n.stage-dot {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 0 #CFD8DC;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.active {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFEB3B 0%, #FFC107 100%);\n    transform: scale(1.2);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.5), inset 0 -4px 0 #FF8F00;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.completed {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #69F0AE 0%, #00E676 100%);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 0 #00BFA5;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.locked {\n    opacity: 0.38;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    filter: grayscale(0.85);\n}\n\n/* NÚT BẤM BILLIONAIR 3D CHUNKY */\n.tycoon-btn {\n    min-width: 60px;\n    min-height: 52px;\n    padding: 10px 22px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    transition: all 0.12s ease;\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:active:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: translateY(5px);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:disabled {\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    filter: grayscale(0.3);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFD54F 0%, #FFA000 100%);\n    color: #4E342E;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #E65100, 0 12px 22px rgba(230, 81, 0, 0.35);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary:active:not(:disabled) {\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #E65100;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #69F0AE 0%, #00E676 100%);\n    color: #004D40;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #00897B, 0 12px 22px rgba(0, 137, 123, 0.35);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green:active:not(:disabled) {\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #00897B;\n}\n\n/* Cổng Ba Mẹ: Vòng giữ 3 giây */\n.parent-gate-btn {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring circle {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: #FF5722;\n    stroke-width: 5;\n    stroke-dasharray: 175;\n    stroke-dashoffset: 175;\n    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.1s linear;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC (PARENT PROMPT SIGNBOARD)\n   - Chữ to $\\ge 22px$, dễ đọc trong 2 giây, rực rỡ phong cách BillionAir\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-prompt-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    margin: 4px auto 10px auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    z-index: 40;\n}\n\n.parent-prompt-signboard {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FFFDE7 100%);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    padding: 12px 24px;\n    border: 4px solid #FFCA28;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #FFA000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.prompt-icon-badge {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    animation: gentle-sway 2.5s infinite;\n}\n\n.prompt-speech-text {\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1A237E;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   SCREENS VIEWPORT & THEMED BACKGROUNDS (8 MÀN CHƠI)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.screens-viewport {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(100vh - 150px);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.screen {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transform: scale(0.96) translateY(20px);\n    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.25, 0.64, 1), visibility 0.35s;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 6px 16px 20px 16px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n}\n\n.screen.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: scale(1) translateY(0);\n}\n\n#screen-1 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFF9C4 0%, #FFE082 50%, #FFCC80 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-2 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFF3E0 0%, #FFE0B2 50%, #FFAB91 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-3 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E0F7FA 0%, #B2EBF2 50%, #80DEEA 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-4 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E1F5FE 0%, #B3E5FC 50%, #81D4FA 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-5 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E8EAF6 0%, #C5CAE9 50%, #9FA8DA 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-6 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E1F5FE 0%, #81D4FA 50%, #29B6F6 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-7 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #EDE7F6 0%, #D1C4E9 50%, #B39DDB 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-8 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFFDE7 0%, #FFF59D 50%, #FFE082 100%);\n}\n\n.screen.has-bg-slice {\n    background-size: cover !important;\n    background-position: center !important;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI\n   ========================================================================== */\n.wardrobe-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.wardrobe-cabinet {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFE082 0%, #FFCA28 100%);\n    border: 6px solid #FFA000;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #E65100, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 96px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 3px solid #FFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #CFD8DC, 0 10px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile:active {\n    cursor: grabbing;\n    transform: scale(1.18) rotate(4deg);\n    z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.bin-avatar-card {\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 280px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 6px solid #FFCA28;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #FFA000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 14px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-slot-item {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n   ========================================================================== */\n.suitcase-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 880px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.suitcase-box-red {\n    width: 280px;\n    height: 300px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5252 0%, #D50000 100%);\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 6px solid #8E0000;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 0 #5f0000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.suitcase-inner-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    background: #FFCDD2;\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    border: 3px dashed #B71C1C;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-items: center;\n}\n\n.suitcase-bear-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 12px;\n    right: 12px;\n    font-size: 44px;\n    animation: gentle-pulse 2s infinite;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH\n   ========================================================================== */\n.security-station-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.station-pod {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    border: 4px solid #B3E5FC;\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #81D4FA, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky {\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 95px;\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px dashed #FFB300;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    padding: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky:active {\n    transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-3deg);\n}\n\n.stamp-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(0);\n    border: 4px solid #00E676;\n    color: #00E676;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.stamp-badge.stamped {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.15);\n}\n\n.xray-screen-neon {\n    width: 180px;\n    height: 110px;\n    background: #00251A;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    border: 3px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.5);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 6px;\n}\n\n.xray-tap-box {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 48px;\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #00E676;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.xray-tap-box:active {\n    transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n\n.gate-detector-chunky {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 180px;\n    border: 14px solid #78909C;\n    border-bottom: none;\n    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: rgba(236, 239, 241, 0.6);\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.gate-lamps-row {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -22px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #CFD8DC;\n    border: 2px solid #546E7A;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led.green-flash {\n    background: #00E676;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px #00E676;\n    animation: lamp-blink 0.25s alternate 6;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY\n   ========================================================================== */\n.boarding-hall-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 920px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.gates-array-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.gate-pillar {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: #263238;\n    color: #FFD54F;\n    border: 5px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #102027;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar:active {\n    transform: scale(1.1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar.matched {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2E7D32 0%, #1B5E20 100%);\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #004D40, 0 0 22px #00E676;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC\n   ========================================================================== */\n.cabin-seat-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.seat-plush-box {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1976D2 0%, #0D47A1 100%);\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 8px solid #0D47A1;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #002171, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    padding: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led {\n    background: #FF5252;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    transition: background 0.3s;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led.green-safe {\n    background: #00E676;\n    color: #004D40;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px #00E676;\n}\n\n.knight-cape-icon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50px;\n    font-size: 54px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.5);\n    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.knight-cape-icon.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n.seatbelt-straps-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    height: 70px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.strap-left, .strap-right {\n    height: 46px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.strap-left {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 90px;\n    border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-insert {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -18px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background: #B0BEC5;\n    border: 3px solid #78909C;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.strap-right {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 90px;\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-receiver {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -18px;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 42px;\n    background: #90A4AE;\n    border: 3px solid #546E7A;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .strap-left {\n    transform: translateX(18px) !important;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .buckle-receiver {\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-color: #00BFA5;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH\n   ========================================================================== */\n.cloud-window-frame {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    height: 310px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #29B6F6 0%, #81D4FA 60%, #E1F5FE 100%);\n    border-radius: 44px;\n    border: 14px solid #ECEFF1;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 12px 0 #CFD8DC, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    padding: 16px 26px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 3px solid transparent;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile:active {\n    transform: scale(1.25);\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile.morphed {\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-color: #FFD54F;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #FFD54F;\n    animation: gentle-bounce 0.6s infinite alternate;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.etiquette-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.etiquette-card-chunky {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 4px solid #B3E5FC;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #81D4FA, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-options {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn {\n    width: 72px;\n    height: 72px;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    background: #FFF;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #B0BEC5;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn span {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn small {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #455A64;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn:active, .volume-emotion-btn.selected {\n    transform: scale(1.15);\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #00BFA5;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & HUY HIỆU DỰ THƯỞNG (CARO